flowchart TD
    I[Idea / hard task] --> X[Isolated bounded Lab experiment]
    X --> R[Experimental result]
    R -->|not useful| D[Discard / retain history]
    R -->|promising| P[PROMOTION_CANDIDATE]
    P --> V[Independent reproduction / tests / Completion]
    V -->|fail| D
    V -->|pass| G[Normal governance / promotion]
    G --> K[Trusted knowledge / skill / config]
